    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/4f4875e35fa57c2b958cdb5dd6b70c27.svg) ⟨28⟩\nJkatzy⟨28⟩\n/\ncode-comments-small⟨29⟩\nlike 0\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨30⟩ Community 1 ⟨31⟩\nDataset Viewer\nSubset (4)\nredpajama-github · 208k rows\n❌ redpajama-github (208k rows) ❌ the-heap (58k rows) ❌ the-stack (232k rows) ❌ the-stack-v2-dedup (615k rows)\nThe dataset viewer is not available for this subset.\nThe redpajama-github config contains 208 while it should generally contain 3 splits maximum (train/validation/test). If the splits 1C_Enterprise, ABAP, AGS_Script, AIDL, AL... are not used to differentiate between training and evaluation, please consider defining configs of this dataset instead. You can find how to define configs instead of splits here: https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/datasets-data-files-configuration\nNeed help to make the dataset viewer work? Make sure to review how to configure the dataset viewer⟨32⟩, and open a discussion⟨33⟩ for direct support.\n  * Small Subset⟨34⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨35⟩ Comment Dataset \nOpening comments extracted from code datasets with CommentMiner and ML4SE-toolkit.\nFiles are grouped as `<dataset>/<language>/part-*.parquet`.\nThe Hugging Face dataset card declares one config per source dataset and one split-safe language name per language.\nEach row contains `dataset`, `record_id`, `opening_comment`, `language`, `path`, `repo`, `extracted_at`, and `metadata`.\nFor Parquet exports, `metadata` is stored as a JSON string so every source dataset shares one stable schema.\n##   ⟨34⟩ Small Subset \nThis is a deterministic small version of `Jkatzy/code-comments` for scalability testing. Every `(dataset, language)` split contains exactly 1000 rows. Rows are taken from the beginning of each source split; when a source split has fewer than 1000 rows, its available rows are repeated until the split reaches 1000 rows. The Parquet schema and `<dataset>/<language>/part-*.parquet` layout match the full dataset.\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    88\nNumber of rows: 1,113,000 Total file size: 361 MB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨36⟩ Privacy⟨37⟩ About⟨38⟩ Careers⟨39⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
